libcanlock
------------------------------------------
libcanlock is a library for creating and verifying RFC 8315 Netnews
Cancel-Locks. It also provides article header parsers and command line tools.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcanlock-devel-3.3.4-1bl1
  libcanlock3-3.3.4-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  bison-3.8.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  flex-2.6.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://micha.freeshell.org/libcanlock/

Canonical download:
  https://micha.freeshell.org/libcanlock/src/libcanlock-3.3.4.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcanlock-3.3.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcanlock-3.3.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcanlock-3.3.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcanlock-3.3.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcanlock3-3.3.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcanlock-devel-3.3.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

